{"tool_name":"metabolicatlas","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"metabolicatlas","home":"https://metabolicatlas.org","license":"GPL-3.0","summary":"Metabolic Atlas is a web platform integrating open-source genome scale metabolic models (GEMs) for easy browsing and analysis. The goal is to collect curated GEMs, and to bring these models closer to FAIR principles. The website provides visualisations and comparisons of the GEMs, and links to resources, algorithms, other databases, and more general software applications. Metabolic Atlas is intended to be used for applications in metabolomics, clinical chemistry, biomarker discovery and general education. In short, the vision is to create a one-stop-shop for everything metabolism related.","addition_date":"2020-04-23T07:50:13Z","last_update_date":"2025-08-31T22:25:13.264963Z","tool_type":["Web application"],"version":["1.0 - 1.7","2.0 - 2.6","3.0 - 3.5+"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:metabolicatlas","credit":[{"email":"contact@metabolicatlas.org","name":"Mihail Anton","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7753-9042","typeRole":["Primary contact"]}],"documentation":[{"type":["API documentation"],"url":"https://metabolicatlas.org/api"},{"type":["User manual"],"url":"https://metabolicatlas.org/documentation"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Expression profile pathway mapping","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0533"},{"term":"Map drawing","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0573"},{"term":"Pathway visualisation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3926"}]}],"maturity":"Mature","name":"Metabolic Atlas","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"M","publication":[{"doi":"10.1073/pnas.2102344118","metadata":{"citationCount":69,"date":"2021-07-27T00:00:00Z","journal":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences of the United States of America","title":"Genome-scale metabolic network reconstruction of model animal